  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conference Implementing Start-Up Act DR Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In a previous project, the consultation process and development of the Start-Up Act in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (DR Congo) was supported by the Netherlands. The law has now been adopted by the Congolese government. The project at hand is a conference in Kinshasa on the implementation of the law. The goal is to raise awareness and inform entrepreneurs and stakeholders about this recently adopted law and the changes it will bring. Also, the conference should facilitate the dialogue between stakeholders and the government on implementation and the next steps to be taken. It is expected that at least part of the recommended measures will be adopted.</narrative>
  </description>
